/target

# git worktrees for isolated feature work
.worktrees/
.claude/

# Lane status: a claim about right now, deliberately volatile, and the contract
# (empyrean contract/LANE_STATUS.md rule 5) makes local disk authoritative and
# tracking the lane's own call. Untracked-and-not-ignored was the third state:
# it left `sigil --version` reporting `tree: dirty` permanently, for a file no
# build reads, so consumers pinning this assembler read a warning that could
# never turn off. Durable history belongs in the committed docs/lane-log.jsonl.
docs/lane-status.json
